      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;There will be many improvements to multi-CPU scalability in the upcoming 9.2 release. This presentation gives a sneak-peek preview of the changes that have been made, and presents the current status of PostgreSQL scalability.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
